{"unit_id":"sixtysevenlf__dsh-sound-alerts#feature-1","repo":"sixtysevenlf/dsh-sound-alerts","commit":"a9b794fa3a7c872e97f28ae374964d37d132d60f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh-external/dsh-sound-alerts 的功能「会话事件提醒」：监视会话状态，在需要授权或回答问题、运行结束、任务失败及 goal 完成时播放对应提示音。事件由会话列表和当前会话快照更新触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:483","src/client/index.ts:533","src/client/index.ts:555","src/client/index.ts:571"]}
